{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero -\u00a0Lothair</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915510/extras/34ef51897700b9c57ca2a9c30074c4ce.avif?t=1754984042\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the hero -\u00a0Lothair</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A steadfast knight of the great axe, the valiance of a lion incarnate, and the sworn guardian of the Court. Throughout the Wasting of the Court, Lothair stood a lone defiant vigil over its crystal heart. Ultimately becoming consumed by the abyss for his efforts, he was reforged into a savage, bloodthirsty beast. Now, by fortuitous intervention from an outlander that managed to drive the darkness from his soul, Lothair resolves to atone for the Court he once swore an oath to die protecting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915510?t=1754984042","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915510?t=1754984042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915510/8c96a3e1e9e6b00c06155b91176d63c31643eed7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754984042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915510/8c96a3e1e9e6b00c06155b91176d63c31643eed7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754984042","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero -\u00a0Lothair</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img